      "content": "Wait, I don't follow. I'm looking for a technical breakdown of the mechanism, not a metaphor. Can you please ignore the analogies and just give me the actual chemical steps? I need to understand the nucleophilic attack of the amino group on the carbonyl group of the sugar. How does that specific interaction lead to the formation of glycosylamines?",
